# Image digests published by CI for this revision. Consumed by user-data.sh,
# which sources this file after cloning the pinned commit.
#
# These are immutable repository@sha256: references. `latest` is never used: a
# mutable tag is how an earlier attempt ran code from a revision that had not
# been tested. With all three present the guest pulls exactly these and
# compiles nothing, so the measurement server's CPU credits are not spent on a
# 58-minute build. Clear them to fall back to building from the checkout, which
# is the mode CI exercises.
#
# Source revision: b0b8289b5053d701b8071ba7ad0b6d827bd88cc1 (the PR merge commit
# CI built from). See docs/results/stage3/image-provenance.md.
